    {
      "name": "descale-the-k-loop-fp8-blockscale-gemm",
      "description": "Fold and hoist block scales out of the fp8 GEMM K-loop until the inner loop is a plain non-scaled MFMA: 20.2x per-case stacked on gfx950",
      "keywords": [
        "fp8",
