      "name": "fp8-gemm-latency-hiding-axes-closed",
      "description": "Once the fp8 GEMM K-loop is scale-free, the latency-hiding axes (num_stages, bigger tiles, nonkdim 32, VGPR shave, LDS bypass) all return <=1.0x on gfx950",
